WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.445 --> 00:00:11.345
Danny woke up.

2
00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:15.489
He looked at the clock, turned over, and went back to sleep.

3
00:00:16.189 --> 00:00:20.553
The alarm woke him up again, but still he didn't get out of bed.

4
00:00:23.035 --> 00:00:26.058
Danny's mother saw her son still asleep in bed.

5
00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:28.320
She shook him by the shoulders.

6
00:00:28.948 --> 00:00:30.149
"Come on, Danny.

7
00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.631
It's time to get ready for school."

8
00:00:32.651 --> 00:00:36.914
"I don't want to go!

9
00:00:37.394 --> 00:00:39.456
I can't stand the thought of school!"

10
00:00:42.298 --> 00:00:43.739
Danny's mother frowned.

11
00:00:43.759 --> 00:00:45.420
"Now, Danny.

12
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.122
I know, and you know, you must go to school.

13
00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:52.325
I'm tired of telling you to get up every day.

14
00:00:52.805 --> 00:00:53.726
So, get up!"

15
00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.833
Finally, Danny got up very slowly.

16
00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:02.176
He got ready for school very slowly.

17
00:01:02.816 --> 00:01:06.279
Danny even ate his breakfast very slowly.

18
00:01:06.879 --> 00:01:10.201
He chewed each piece of food for almost a minute.

19
00:01:12.643 --> 00:01:15.105
Danny's mother was getting very angry.

20
00:01:15.925 --> 00:01:19.688
She spoke again to her son, "Look at the time!

21
00:01:20.088 --> 00:01:21.469
You'll be late, Danny.

22
00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.030
Finish your breakfast.

23
00:01:23.391 --> 00:01:24.712
You must go to school!"

24
00:01:27.852 --> 00:01:30.355
Danny looked at his mother and shook his head.

25
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:32.877
"I don't want to go to school.

26
00:01:33.378 --> 00:01:34.819
I don't care if I am late.

27
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.822
I never want to go to school again!"

28
00:01:40.265 --> 00:01:43.007
Danny's mother folded her arms across her chest.

29
00:01:43.648 --> 00:01:45.310
She looked sternly at her son.

30
00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:51.056
"Danny, you know as well as I do: you must go to school."

31
00:01:53.856 --> 00:01:55.858
Danny looked up at his mother angrily.

32
00:01:55.878 --> 00:01:59.460
"Give me two good reasons why I should go to school."

33
00:02:02.082 --> 00:02:05.384
Danny's mother rolled her eyes and then looked at her son.

34
00:02:05.404 --> 00:02:09.467
"First, you are 45 years old.

35
00:02:10.148 --> 00:02:13.590
And second, you are the principal of the school."

36
00:02:16.012 --> 00:02:17.413
Danny glared at his mother.

37
00:02:17.893 --> 00:02:19.414
He pushed his breakfast away.

38
00:02:19.915 --> 00:02:21.256
He picked up his briefcase.

39
00:02:21.661 --> 00:02:24.211
And he slammed the door as he left for school.
